# Copy this file to .env and fill in values ONLY when a lesson asks for them.
# Never commit .env — it is listed in .gitignore.
#
# Days 01-05 need no environment variables and no API keys. Day 04 downloads a small open
# embedding model once; these two OPTIONAL settings only matter on restricted networks:
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://proxy.example.com:8080   # your organisation's proxy
# HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.example.com   # a Hugging Face mirror, if huggingface.co is blocked
# Later days that use a hosted model or service will add placeholder entries here,
# together with a free/local alternative where one exists.
